# Pharmacy Simulator

Application Name:

Pharmacy Simulator

The simulator should resemble traditional Windows healthcare software.

Design:

* Tab based interface
* Data grids
* Modal forms
* Heavy keyboard navigation

Avoid modern web-like UI design.

