# Dynamic Layout Mode

Critical Requirement

Create:

Randomize Layout Toggle

When enabled:

* Sections move
* Groups reorder
* Panels reposition
* Controls move

BUT:

accessibleName remains unchanged

objectName remains unchanged

Purpose:

Simulate pharmacy-specific customizations.

---

# Accessibility Requirements

Every control MUST expose:

objectName

accessibleName

Examples:

txt_first_name

txt_last_name

txt_dob

grid_allergies

btn_save

btn_update

Automation must never rely on coordinates.

