---

# Automation Workflow

Load Test Patient

Example:

{
"first_name": "John",
"last_name": "Doe",
"dob": "1990-01-01",
"phone": "5551234567",
"email": "[john@example.com](mailto:john@example.com)",
"health_card": "HC123456"
}

Automation Steps:

1. Open Patient Record
2. Locate First Name Field
3. Enter Value
4. Read Value Back
5. Verify Match
6. Continue
7. Save Record

